{"id": "w1231", "correct": "on such a man", "distractors": [{"text": "Therefore", "error_type": "wrong_sense", "explanation": "「于是人也」的「于是」是「于＋是」＝给这样的人，不是今义的「因此」"}, {"text": "at that time", "error_type": "wrong_sense", "explanation": "把「是」读成时间词；「是人」指这样的人，不指时候"}, {"text": "from this place", "error_type": "wrong_sense", "explanation": "「于」在此是「给、对」，不是「从」"}]}
{"id": "w0667", "correct": "Therefore", "distractors": [{"text": "on such a man", "error_type": "wrong_sense", "explanation": "这是「于是人也」里「于＋是」的读法；本句「于是」是「在这种情况下」"}, {"text": "At that moment", "error_type": "wrong_sense", "explanation": "「于是」承接上文结果，是「因此」，不是单纯的时间点"}, {"text": "In this place", "error_type": "wrong_sense", "explanation": "把「是」读成地点；本句指事态，不指处所"}]}
